"""Sealed Phase 8 machine-preparation controller for the local campaign.

The controller prepares blinded human-audit material only. It never recruits a
rater, supplies a human label, adjudicates a disagreement, analyses labels, or
claims Gate 8. A successful process exit means only that deterministic machine
preparation completed; the terminal record remains human-only blocked.
"""

